          <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:#fc7604; white-space:nowrap;">arXiv:2512.13771 &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.13224" style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:18px 22px; border-bottom:1px solid #171c22; color:#e8ebef;">
          <span style="font-size:14.5px;">A Geometric Taxonomy of Hallucinations in LLMs</span>
